{"speciesId":323,"names":{"fr":"Camérupt","es":"Camerupt","en":"Camerupt","ja":"バクーダ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CAMERUPT has a volcano inside its body. Magma of 18,000 degrees F courses through its body. Occasionally, the humps on this POKéMON’s back erupt, spewing the superheated magma."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"The humps on CAMERUPT’s back are formed by a transformation of its bones. They sometimes blast out molten magma. This POKéMON apparently erupts often when it is enraged."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A POKéMON that lives in the crater of a volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes on its back erupt violently. Research is under way on the cause of eruption."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"If angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives in the crater of a volcano. It is well known that the humps on its back erupt every 10 years."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives in the crater of a volcano. It is well known that the humps on its back erupt every 10 years."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il porte des volcans sur son dos. Quand le magma remonte, il frissonne et entre en éruption."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il porte des volcans sur son dos. Quand le magma remonte, il frissonne et entre en éruption."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The volcanoes on its back have a major eruption every 10 years--or whenever it becomes really angry."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The volcanoes on its back have a major eruption every 10 years--or whenever it becomes really angry."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les volcans sur son dos entrent en éruption tous les dix ans ou chaque fois qu’il se met en colère."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los volcanes de su joroba entran en erupción cada 10 años o cuando Camerupt se enfada mucho."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The volcanoes on its back have a major eruption every 10 years--or whenever it becomes really angry."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"背中の コブの 火山は １０年ごとに 大噴火 するが 激しく 怒っても 噴火する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"S’il s’énerve, Camérupt fait jaillir de la lave en fusion par les bosses qui se trouvent sur son dos. Il vit dans les cratères des volcans."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando se enfada, las jorobas del lomo entran en erupción y expulsan lava. Habita los cráteres de los volcanes."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"怒ると 灼熱の マグマを 背中の コブから 噴き上げる。 火山の 火口に 住処が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps de Camérupt renferme un volcan. Du magma à 10 000 °C coule dans ses veines. De temps en temps, les bosses sur le dos de ce Pokémon entrent en éruption et crachent le magma surchauffé."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Camerupt encierra un volcán en su interior y magma de 10 000 °C le recorre el cuerpo. A veces, las jorobas de la espalda entran en erupción y escupen el abrasivo magma."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Camerupt has a volcano inside its body. Magma of 18,000 degrees Fahrenheit courses through its body. Occasionally, the humps on this Pokémon’s back erupt, spewing the superheated magma."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体の 中に 火山を 持つ ポケモンだ。 体に たまった 摂氏 １万度の マグマを 時々 背中の コブから 噴き上げている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les bosses sur le dos de Camérupt sont apparues après une déformation de ses os. Elles crachent parfois du magma en fusion. Ce Pokémon entre apparemment en éruption lorsqu’il est énervé."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Las jorobas de Camerupt se originaron por una deformación de los huesos. A veces escupen magma líquido, sobre todo cuando el Pokémon se enfada."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The humps on Camerupt’s back are formed by a transformation of its bones. They sometimes blast out molten magma. This Pokémon apparently erupts often when it is enraged."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"背中の コブは 骨が 形を 変えたもの。 煮えたぎった マグマを 時々 噴き上げる。 怒った ときに よく 噴火する らしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":323,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",29],[6,"level-up",29],[7,"level-up",29],[8,"level-up",21],[9,"level-up",21],[10,"level-up",21],[11,"level-up",25],[12,"level-up",29],[13,"level-up",29